  /* ---------- Marquee: infinite scroll of the brand line ----------
     Owner's ask, 2026-09-13 (compatto.gr reference — its own "Simple. ⟠
     Furnishing Made Simple. ⟠ Furn..." band) — same mechanism, our own
     assets: the locked brand-essence line ("Kompetentnost kojoj
     vjeruješ", already used as the about-section tagline) alternating
     with the logo mark (owner's ask, 2026-09-13: the standalone
     text-free mark — logo-mark.svg — not the Signature Shape, and not
